id=wireless-adb-keeper
name=Wireless ADB Keeper
version=v1.1.0
versionCode=3
author=kaandikec
description=Forces wireless ADB onto port 55555 on every boot; avoids conflict with UFI-TOOLS which uses 5555. Restarts adbd to apply, and revives adbd if the service dies while the port stays set.
